<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n47935" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">tertĭānus</span></b> , a,
		um, adj.
		id., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>of</i> or <i>belonging to the third</i>, <i>tertian.</i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>Adj.</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">tertianae febres,</span>”
				i.e. <i>the tertian fever</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Cic.
					N. D. 3, 10, 24</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<i>Substt.</i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>A.</b>
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">tertĭāna</span></b> ,
				ae, f. (sc. febris), <i>the tertian fever</i>, <i><span class="en">Cels. 3, 5</span></i>;
				<i><span class="en">Petr. 17</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Plin. 24,
				19, 107, § 170</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">tertianis et quartanis remedium,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					21, 23, 94, § 166</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">22, 25, 72,
				§ 150</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>B.</b>
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">tertĭāni</span></b> ,
				ōrum, m. (sc. milites), <i>soldiers of the third legion</i>, <i><span class="en">Tac. A. 13,
				38</span></i>; <i><span class="en">id. H. 3, 24</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
